# The public address the site is served from — no trailing slash.
# Drives canonical links, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, Open Graph and JSON-LD.
#
# Local development can leave this unset; the fallback in app/data/profile.ts
# is the live Vercel address. Set it in the Vercel dashboard as soon as a
# custom domain resolves, and every generated URL follows.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://portfolio-nine-rouge-57.vercel.app
